273 13.4421 8.23073 13.3501 8.41473 13.1661C8.59873 12.9821 8.69873 12.7621 8.71473 12.5061C8.72273 12.2421 8.65073 12.0221 8.49873 11.8461Z"></path></svg></div><div class="EnclavesAnimation_skeletonLine__vum_k" data-warn="false" style="width:30%"></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></div><div class="Container_container__0SGNv Process_container__Hfxz1"><div><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7 Process_title__flwsG">Get started with the Enclaves Primitive</h2><p class="styles_text__Fvsk7 Process_subtitle__oRmG1">Deploy and attest your first Secure Enclave using three commands from the Evervault CLI.</p></div><div class="Process_timeline__6hq8O"><div class="Process_step__3OrbR"><div class="Process_stepNumber__RSfcO">Step <!-- -->1</div><div class="Process_lineContainer__DqLfw" data-last="false"><svg width="1" height="100%"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100%" stroke="var(--grey-00)" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0px 1px"></line></svg><div class="Process_stepMarker__vyvDX"><div class="Process_stepMarkerInner__bCZEh" style="width:0px;height:0px;opacity:1"></div></div></div><div class="Process_content__46rbk"><h3>Build</h3><p class="Process_stepBody__T8RU0">Use the Enclaves CLI to convert a Docker image to an enclave image — locally, or in your CI/CD pipeline.</p><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_container__lufw6" style="height:260px"><div class="CodeTabs_container___fKbI"><div class="CodeTabs_tabs__JW7qa"><button class="CodeTabs_tab__LO7L_ CodeTabs_active__JXkR1">Terminal</button><div class="CodeTabs_filler__Dwp7Z CodeTabs_fillerAfterActive__vFWtt"></div></div></div><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_code__qL_e9"><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_commandContainer__5VZw9"><div>~ ev-enclave build -f ./Dockerfile .</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Process_step__3OrbR"><div class="Process_stepNumber__RSfcO">Step <!-- -->2</div><div class="Process_lineContainer__DqLfw" data-last="false"><svg width="1" height="100%"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100%" stroke="var(--grey-00)" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0px 1px"></line></svg><div class="Process_stepMarker__vyvDX"><div class="Process_stepMarkerInner__bCZEh" style="width:0px;height:0px;opacity:1"></div></div></div><div class="Process_content__46rbk"><h3>Deploy</h3><p class="Process_stepBody__T8RU0">Upload your enclave image to Evervault, and we’ll provision and scale your enclave automatically.</p><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_container__lufw6" style="height:300px"><div class="CodeTabs_container___fKbI"><div class="CodeTabs_tabs__JW7qa"><button class="CodeTabs_tab__LO7L_ CodeTabs_active__JXkR1">Terminal</button><div class="CodeTabs_filler__Dwp7Z CodeTabs_fillerAfterActive__vFWtt"></div></div></div><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_code__qL_e9"><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_commandContainer__5VZw9"><div>~ ev-enclave deploy .</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Process_step__3OrbR"><div class="Process_stepNumber__RSfcO">Step <!-- -->3</div><div class="Process_lineContainer__DqLfw" data-last="true"><svg width="1" height="100%"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100%" stroke="var(--grey-00)" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0px 1px"></line></svg><div class="Process_stepMarker__vyvDX"><div class="Process_stepMarkerInner__bCZEh" style="width:0px;height:0px;opacity:1"></div></div></div><div class="Process_content__46rbk"><h3>Attest</h3><p class="Process_stepBody__T8RU0">Attest and request your application using the Evervault SDK — so you can verify the code you wrote is the code you’re running.</p><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_container__lufw6" style="height:360px"><div class="CodeTabs_container___fKbI"><div class="CodeTabs_tabs__JW7qa"><button class="CodeTabs_tab__LO7L_ CodeTabs_active__JXkR1">Terminal</button><div class="CodeTabs_filler__Dwp7Z CodeTabs_fillerAfterActive__vFWtt"></div></div></div><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_code__qL_e9"><div class="EnclavesCommandAsset_commandContainer__5VZw9"><div>~ curl https://my-enclave.uuid.evervault.com</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Container_container__0SGNv"><div class="CalloutLink_container__QZ6v8"><div><h6 class="CalloutLink_guidesLabel__B_WSN">Trust from the ground up</h6><h4 class="CalloutLink_title__U_XBy">Open Source</h4><p class="CalloutLink_description__iRb39">Security by obscurity doesn&#x27;t cut it. Enclaves are auditable and transparent by default, and run without any proprietary agents, runtimes or libraries.</p><a class="Credentials_learnMore__E8hvx" href="https://github.com/evervault/cages" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Available on GitHub<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path class="Credentials_chevronOne__Wi4uo" d="M6 17L11 12 6 7"></path><path class="Credentials_chevronTwo___M6Fe" d="M13 17L18 12 13 7"></path></svg></a></div><img src="../images/cages-os.png" class="GitHubAsset_asset__cvaAV"/></div></div><div class="styles_background__Lhd1K"><div class="Container_container__0SGNv"><div class="Features_heading__0Kk_5"><h2 style="--width:70%" class="styles_text__Fvsk7">Effortless deployments with provable security</h2><p class="Features_subHeading__N7HnS">Easily run sensitive workloads in completely segregated environments with heavily restricted external access.</p></div><div><div><div class="Features_divider__1WGjU"></div><div class="Features_features__aEjtw"><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h5>Attest code integrity</h5></div><p>Verify that the code you’re running is the code you wrote and signed, guaranteed by cryptographic attestation.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-radar"><path d="M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34"></path><path d="M4 6h.01"></path><path d="M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35"></path><path d="M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66"></path></svg><h5>Full isolation</h5></div><p>Isolate sensitive workloads from the internet, and verify that sensitive data never leaves your enclave.</p></div><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package-plus"><path d="M16 16h6"></path><path d="M19 13v6"></path><path d="M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l2-1.14"></path><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="22" y2="12"></line></svg><h5>Lift and shift</h5></div><p>Easily deploy any existing Docker container into a Secure Enclave.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Features_divider__1WGjU"></div><div class="Features_features__aEjtw"><div><div class="Features_featureTitle__oyjT_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r